@api = http://localhost:5000

### 1. Danh sach bai tap - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### 2. Chi tiet bai tap 1 - 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### 3. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### 4. Nop bai hop le - 201 + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200718",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ThanDinhNguyen/CNTTK23D"
}

### 5. Doc lai luot nop tu ID cua request 4 - 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### 6. Ma sinh vien rong - 400 + INVALID_SUBMISSION
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ThanDinhNguyen/CNTTK23D"
}

### 7. Bai tap da dong - 400 + ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200718",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ThanDinhNguyen/CNTTK23D"
}

### 8. Bai tap khong ton tai - 404 + ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200718",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/ThanDinhNguyen/CNTTK23D"
}
